@Secur_O_Send.Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106
@authToken = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN

### Get Weather Forecast

GET {{Secur_O_Send.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/weather-forecast/get-weather-forecast
Accept: application/json

### Send Message

POST {{Secur_O_Send.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/messages/send
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "message": "Hello, this is a test message!"
}

###

GET {{Secur_O_Send.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/messages/get-new
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Secur_O_Send.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/messages/get-all
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json